2. Information We Process
Depending on the features you use, CarMemos processes:
- Account information: Username, login credentials, account identifiers, and profile information you provide.
- Vehicle information: Vehicle brand, model, license plate, mileage, photographs, maintenance dates, costs, reminders, and notes.
- AI conversation content: Your questions, relevant conversation history, selected images, voice recordings, and transcribed text.
- Technical information: App version, device information, and network information involved in requests to our services.
- Support information: Information you provide when contacting us.
Avoid submitting sensitive information or other people’s personal information unless necessary and you have permission.
3. How We Use Information
We process information to authenticate accounts, provide vehicle-management features, generate AI responses, process requested media, provide support, and maintain service security.
Where applicable law requires a legal basis, processing relies on performance of our agreement with you, your consent, compliance with legal obligations, or legitimate interests such as protecting the service.
4. Local Storage
Vehicle records, associated photographs, maintenance records, reminders, and conversation history are stored locally on your device in the current implementation.
Local storage does not mean all app activity stays on your device. Account functions and AI requests involve external services. Device backups may also contain local app data, depending on your settings.
5. AI and Speech Processing
The current AI integration sends submitted text, relevant conversation history, and selected images to DeepSeek to generate responses.
Voice recordings are stored locally. Speech recognition uses Apple’s speech-recognition services and may involve processing by Apple, depending on device capabilities and service availability. The confirmed transcription is included in the AI request.
6. Device Permissions
CarMemos may request access to:
- Camera: To take photographs you choose to use.
- Photos: To select images or save images to your photo library.
- Microphone: To record voice messages.
- Speech recognition: To convert recordings into text.
- Notifications: To deliver supported alerts.
You can manage permissions in your device settings. Refusing a permission may prevent the related feature from working.
7. Sharing and International Processing
Information is shared with service providers when needed to operate account services, process AI requests, or provide features you request. We may also disclose information where legally required or necessary to protect rights and security.
Providers may process information outside your country. Where required, we use appropriate legal safeguards for international transfers.
